Subject: [PATCH] Prune stale policy oneof arms on custom entitlement update

The generated custom resource serializes every optional policy arm, and merge() keeps the prior-state arm next to the replacement, so switching arms sends two arms and the API rejects the body. Hook the hand-maintained pruneCustomAppEntitlementPolicyOneofs into Update after merge().

diff --git a/internal/provider/custom_app_entitlement_resource.go b/internal/provider/custom_app_entitlement_resource.go
index a10ec304..0c60bde4 100644
--- a/internal/provider/custom_app_entitlement_resource.go
+++ b/internal/provider/custom_app_entitlement_resource.go
@@ -1810,6 +1810,11 @@ func (r *CustomAppEntitlementResource) Update(ctx context.Context, req resource.
 		return
 	}
 
+	resp.Diagnostics.Append(pruneCustomAppEntitlementPolicyOneofs(ctx, req.Config, data)...)
+	if resp.Diagnostics.HasError() {
+		return
+	}
+
 	request, requestDiags := data.ToOperationsC1APIAppV1AppEntitlementsUpdateRequest(ctx)
 	resp.Diagnostics.Append(requestDiags...)
 
